# Copy this file to .env and fill in what you have. The .env file is git
# ignored, and a key must never be committed: Google scans public code for its
# own keys and revokes any it finds, so a hardcoded key stops working by itself.
#
# Everything works without this. The forecast, the temperatures and the
# clothing advice all come from live weather data either way; a Gemini key
# only upgrades the wording of the advice to an AI written paragraph.
#
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
